<title>GERMANY: German intervention barley, rye sought for export.</title>
<headline>German intervention barley, rye sought for export.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>German grain traders placed bids for the export of 38,200 tonnes of intervention barley and 8,500 tonnes of intervention rye to third countries, state grain intervention board BLE said.</p>
<p>The bids will be discussed at the EU weekly grain meeting later on Thursday.</p>
<p>-Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
</text>
